<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ruby - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/Ruby/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:47:32 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/Ruby/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>从0到1搭建移动App功能自动化测试平台 (4)：自动化测试代码⎡工程化⎦</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-refactor-testcase-scripts/</link><pubDate>Thu, 28 Jul 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-refactor-testcase-scripts/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在本系列的&lt;a href="https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-write-iOS-testcase-scripts/"&gt;上一篇文章&lt;/a&gt;中，我通过系统登录这一典型功能点，演示了编写自动化测试脚本的整个流程，并对测试脚本进行了初步优化。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在本文中，我将重点介绍如何对自动化测试脚本实现⎡工程化⎦的组织和管理。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="测试脚本工程化"&gt;&lt;span&gt;测试脚本⎡工程化⎦&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e6%b5%8b%e8%af%95%e8%84%9a%e6%9c%ac%e5%b7%a5%e7%a8%8b%e5%8c%96" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;首先说下什么是测试脚本的工程化。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>从0到1搭建移动App功能自动化测试平台（3）：编写iOS自动化测试脚本</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-write-iOS-testcase-scripts/</link><pubDate>Mon, 30 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-write-iOS-testcase-scripts/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;p&gt;通过前面三篇文章，我们已经将iOS自动化功能测试的开发环境全部准备就绪，也学习了iOS UI控件交互操作的一般性方法，接下来，就可以开始编写自动化测试脚本了。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>从0到1搭建移动App功能自动化测试平台（2）：操作iOS应用的控件</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-Appium-interrogate-iOS-UI/</link><pubDate>Sun, 29 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/build-app-automated-test-platform-from-0-to-1-Appium-interrogate-iOS-UI/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/OpenSource/">OpenSource</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="写在前面"&gt;&lt;span&gt;写在前面&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%86%99%e5%9c%a8%e5%89%8d%e9%9d%a2" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;前两天微信突然发来一条系统消息，提示&lt;code&gt;DebugTalk&lt;/code&gt;可以开通原创标识了（同时也有了评论功能），虽然一直在期待，但没想到来得这么快，着实是个不小的惊喜。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>